 12	/**
 13	 * A builder for constructing a JSON Patch by adding
 14	 * JSON Patch operations incrementally.
 15	 * <p>
 16	 * The following illustrates the approach.
 17	 * <pre>
 18	 *   JsonPatchBuilder builder = Json.createPatchBuilder();
